DEVICE SPIKE

# PULSE PERCUSSION, CrispStrobe — BSD-3-Clause.
# Reset first. One shaft controls the 0/90/180-degree peg phases mechanically.
# Two revolutions each at about 15, 30 and 45 rpm; every channel drops twice per stage.
WHEN flag clicked:
  set motor stop action A hold
  set motor speed A 8
  run motor A clockwise 720 degrees
  set motor speed A 16
  run motor A clockwise 720 degrees
  set motor speed A 24
  run motor A clockwise 720 degrees
  wait 2 seconds
